WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
IAB vacuum check valve
What it does: Restricts flow to one direction to preserve reservoir vacuum.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
IAB vacuum check valve
How it works: When the difference reverses, the closing element seats.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
IAB vacuum check valve
How it moves: Its internal closing element responds to pressure difference, not a fixed crankshaft angle.
